{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And in you shall all the families of the earth be blessed.</b> There are many aggadot, and this is its plain sense: a person says to his son, 'May you be like Avraham.' And so every 'וְנִבְרְכוּ בְךָ' in Scripture. And this proves it: ״בְּךָ יְבָרֵךְ יִשְׂרָאֵל לֵאמֹר יְשִׂמְךָ אֱלֹהִים כְּאֶפְרַיִם וְכִמְנַשֶּׁה״ (Genesis 48)."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:58:22.542221661Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}